    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_legality_query" kindref="compound">LegalityQuery</ref> object bundles together all the information that&apos;s needed to decide whether a given operation is legal or not. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For efficiency, it doesn&apos;t make a copy of Types so care must be taken not to free it before using the query. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
